# Responsive by Default

- Every UI implementation must work across mobile, tablet, and desktop.
- Match breakpoint behavior from `design.pen` when available.
- Validate spacing, typography, and layout at all target breakpoints.
- Avoid desktop-only assumptions; mobile behavior must be intentionally designed.
- Prefer responsive Tailwind classes and consistent layout primitives.
- If a requested change risks breaking a breakpoint, update all affected breakpoints in the same task.
